blurb = "Depicts Yamabiko (\"mountain boy\", homophone for \"echo\"), a yōkai that appears in the mountains. When echoes appear to be coming from a mysterious origin or come back sounding different, they are attributed to a yamabiko. It is a relatively harmless yōkai, causing confusion rather than any serious injury. They are usually depicted as a hybrid between a dog and a monkey in a shrugging pose."
